  dialogueSteps:
  - characterName: Narrator
    expressionName: '-'
    dialogueEN: Not focused on listening to the figure who resembled him.
    dialogueID: Tidak fokus mendengarkan sosok yang mirip dengan dirinya.
  - characterName: Narrator
    expressionName: '-'
    dialogueEN: Elara's legs were trembling, and her heart was pounding.
    dialogueID: Kaki Elara bergetar dan jantungnya berdegup kencang.
  - characterName: Narrator
    expressionName: '-'
    dialogueEN: Unintentionally, Elara slowly walked backward.
    dialogueID: Secara tidak sengajaa, Elara berjalan mundur perlahan-lahan.
  - characterName: Narrator
    expressionName: '-'
    dialogueEN: Until she didn't realize it. Elara fell.
    dialogueID: Hingga tanpa ia sadari. Elara terjatuh.
  loadSceneAfterNarration: 0
  sceneNameAfterNarration: 
